    "ORZ3TeYPA0s": {
      "result": "verified_selected_lines",
      "notes": "Three branches, 38 exact positions from the complete seven-piece root. Qf4+/Qf7+ and d8=N+ fork win the queen, Nxb7 answers the discovered ...Kf6+ check; king pursuit reaches Kc2 before Nb3 mate. Queen promotion loses, but ...Qh1+ is not immediate mate as claimed: independently checked Qh4 (only legal reply), ...Qxh4 mate completes the branch. Sending the knight alone draws. Clock-adjudication claim is explicitly outside verified scope and not taught as a rule.",
